{
  "intro": "Looking for a hotel near Syracuse, NY? The Cicero Grand sits at I-81 Exit 30, six minutes from Micron's $100B megafab in Clay, twelve from Destiny USA, fifteen from downtown Syracuse, and minutes from Oneida Lake, Onondaga Lake Park, and Syracuse Hancock International Airport. We host project crews, traveling teams, families, and weekend visitors. This is our locals' guide to Central New York — what to do, where to eat, and how close it all is to our front door.",
  "seoBlurb": "The Cicero Grand is one of the closest hotels to Micron, Destiny USA, the JMA Wireless Dome, and Syracuse Hancock International Airport. Every suite sleeps four with a separate living area, free hot breakfast, indoor heated pool, free parking, and pet-friendly rooms.",
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "What's the closest hotel to Micron in Syracuse?",
      "a": "The Cicero Grand is six minutes from the Micron megafab campus in Clay, NY \u2014 making us one of the closest full-service hotels to the build site. We host project crews, vendors, and visiting engineers with extended-stay rates, direct billing, and free truck and trailer parking."
    },
    {
      "q": "How far is The Cicero Grand from Syracuse Hancock International Airport (SYR)?",
      "a": "Fourteen minutes by car. We're a straight shot south on I-81 from the airport, with no tolls. Park free in our lot during your stay or while you fly."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is The Cicero Grand close to Destiny USA?",
      "a": "Yes \u2014 twelve minutes south on I-81 to Destiny USA, New York's largest shopping center with 250+ stores, restaurants, and entertainment."
    },
    {
      "q": "How far are we from the JMA Wireless Dome and Syracuse University?",
      "a": "Sixteen minutes to the JMA Wireless Dome and the SU campus. We're a popular choice for game weekends, parents weekends, and recruiting visits."
    },
    {
      "q": "What's nearby Oneida Lake?",
      "a": "Oneida Shores Park is five minutes north on I-81. The Brewerton boat launches, fishing charters, and Erie Canal access are all less than ten minutes from the hotel."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is the hotel close to Turning Stone Casino?",
      "a": "Thirty-five minutes east on I-90. We're one of the closest non-Turning Stone hotels for guests attending shows, golf tournaments, or events at the resort."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are restaurants within walking distance?",
      "a": "Cracker Barrel is across the street. Cooper-Top Tavern, Hafner's, Sal's Birdland, and several others are within a five-minute drive on Route 11."
    }
  ],
